---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Security Policy — Orbit Web Designs & Marketing" description="How Orbit protects this site and handles vulnerability reports.">
	<main id="main" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-24">
		<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric">■ Security</p>
		<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Security <span class="text-gradient">policy.</span></h1>
		<p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-400">This site is static — no accounts, no databases, no server code. Hardened with strict security headers, HTTPS everywhere, and a tight content policy.</p>
		<div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
			<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><p class="font-semibold text-white">Report a vulnerability</p><p class="mt-2">Email <a href="mailto:mwmwai@gmail.com" class="text-electric hover:underline">mwmwai@gmail.com</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/254741992308" class="text-electric hover:underline">0741 992 308</a> with details and reproduction steps. We acknowledge within 48 hours.</p></div>
			<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><p class="font-semibold text-white">Scope</p><p class="mt-2">orbitwebdesigns.co.ke and all subdomains. Out of scope: third-party services (Vercel, Google, Meta) and social engineering.</p></div>
			<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-6"><p class="font-semibold text-white">Client data</p><p class="mt-2">No client data is stored on this public site. Project credentials live in environment variables only — never in code.</p></div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
